# Kotlin incremental-compilation cache
.kotlin/

# Each integrator supplies their OWN Firebase config, one per flavor — never commit real
# credentials. A file at app/ (rather than app/src/<flavor>/) is picked up by BOTH flavors,
# which is exactly the cross-environment credential sharing the flavor split prevents.
app/src/*/google-services.json
app/google-services.json
